Package: rusckersso
Title: Sign People in Through a Ruscker Portal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("André", "Leite", email = "leite@castlab.org", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4718-9766"))
Description: Two small helpers for R web apps that need to know who is
    using them. Apps hosted inside a Ruscker portal read the identity the
    portal's proxy adds to every request. Shiny and plumber2 apps running
    elsewhere sign people in through the portal's OpenID Connect provider
    (authorization code flow with PKCE, ES256-signed ID tokens), using
    'httr2' for HTTP and 'jose' for signature verification.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://ruscker.com/r/, https://github.com/StrategicProjects/ruscker/tree/main/clients/r
BugReports: https://github.com/StrategicProjects/ruscker/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
